        {
          "text": "Te vini indi Manase oda ’ba ari kakau aka, cazu Yerusalemuni gazu tre engazu kala aluria cazu kala aziniria, e’yo onzi erini erini fele Yudani ’yele, ’dini yi ’ye e’yo ovupi onzi Yehova ma miliari ma dria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
